WEBVTT
NOTE Cedwyn film, frame 013, en. Timings estimated from the script.

1
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.923
<v the census enumerator>Good morning, Mrs Williams. I've come to collect the census paper, the one I left here last week.

2
00:00:19.273 --> 00:00:28.504
<v Mary Williams>Come in, come in. John filled it in last night by the lamplight. Everyone who was under this roof last night, as you asked.

3
00:00:28.854 --> 00:00:36.162
<v John Williams>Here it is. John Williams, head, fifty-three, farmer. Mary, wife. Then the children, eldest first. All tidy, I hope.

4
00:00:36.512 --> 00:00:47.281
<v the census enumerator>Thank you, Mr Williams. I'll copy it all into the book as it stands on the paper, the acres and all. And the house... Llandough Home Farm. There.
